      "message": "WDYT about replacing the `native::CombinedLimits` with this as well? I think it makes sense to move it into `utils` since it could easily be reused in other places also?\n\nThat said, I\u0027m also wondering if it would be possible to generate this with our generators, i.e. `generator/templates/dawn/utils/ComboLimits.*`. If we did that, we could programmatically include all the extension structs for `Limits` by walking it\u0027s extensions, and I assume the helpers below will be fairly simple also to implement to work for all the extensions.",
