      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fine with not generating for now. Thoughts on renaming it to `utils::CombinedLimits` then? I think we should try to replace `native::CombinedLimits` asap to avoid having the duplicated stuff. Probably should add a comment to `native::CombinedLimits` to note that we want to eventually replace it with this one also.\n\nOne more thing, thoughts on making this extend `wgpu::Limits` directly to avoid `v1`, and just have direct access to the core limits?",
