      "side": 1,
      "message": "A minor unfortunate consequence of using inheritance is that `ComboLimits\u0026`/`*` will always silently cast to `wgpu::Limits\u0026`/`*` without calling `GetLinked()`. Before, of course, you could do this with `.v1`, but now it\u0027s automatic. Doesn\u0027t seem to be possible to block this by adding a cast operator. I don\u0027t think this is probably a big problem though.",
